Admit routed QCA8337 VLAN-aware bridge customer interfaces.

Require live port membership and published one-level bridge VLAN uppers.
Preserve QCA rejection of unaware customer bridging, bridged PPP, VLAN+PPP,
non-bridge masters, tunnels and non-routed traffic. Keep all YT paths intact.

--- a/frontends/nss/ecm_nss_common.c
+++ b/frontends/nss/ecm_nss_common.c
